{"id":"150b567749c83f49","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-projective-hierarchy.md","title":"Projective Hierarchy by Real Parameters","display":"df-projective-hierarchy — Projective Hierarchy by Real Parameters","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-projective-hierarchy","aliases":["68-df-projective-hierarchy"],"display":"df-projective-hierarchy — Projective Hierarchy by Real Parameters","depends_on":["[[68-df-baire-space]]","[[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§20 pp.74–75 / PDF 83–84","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"definition-correspondence-reviewed; uses 18.1","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-projective-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-projective-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projective-hierarchy — Projective Hierarchy by Real Parameters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4bd688e6777d088c\" href=\"?note=4bd688e6777d088c\" title=\"68-df-baire-space\">68-df-baire-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4eb7f663287e8b98\" href=\"?note=4eb7f663287e8b98\" title=\"68-df-analytical-hierarchy\">68-df-analytical-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§20 pp.74–75 / PDF 83–84"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-correspondence-reviewed; uses 18.1"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k,r,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k,r,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq X_{m+r,k}\">\\(Q\\subseteq X_{m+r,k}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{m,k}=\\mathcal B^m\\times\\mathbb N^k\">\\(X_{m,k}=\\mathcal B^m\\times\\mathbb N^k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4bd688e6777d088c\" href=\"?note=4bd688e6777d088c\" title=\"68-df-baire-space\">68-df-baire-space</a>；无固定实参数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}\">\\(\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4eb7f663287e8b98\" href=\"?note=4eb7f663287e8b98\" title=\"68-df-analytical-hierarchy\">68-df-analytical-hierarchy</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m\">\\(\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\beta\\in\\mathcal B^r\">\\(\\vec\\beta\\in\\mathcal B^r\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 为有限元组连接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=0\">\\(r=0\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\beta=()\">\\(\\vec\\beta=()\\)</span>。下式引入 section 算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sec}_{m,k}^r\">\\(\\operatorname{Sec}_{m,k}^r\\)</span> 及带任意有限实参数的粗体关系类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sec}_{m,k}^r(Q,\\vec\\beta):=\\{(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}:(\\vec\\alpha\\frown\\vec\\beta,\\vec x)\\in Q\\},\\qquad Q\\subseteq X_{m+r,k}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sec}_{m,k}^r(Q,\\vec\\beta):=\\{(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}:(\\vec\\alpha\\frown\\vec\\beta,\\vec x)\\in Q\\},\\qquad Q\\subseteq X_{m+r,k}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}:=\\{A\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\vec\\beta\\in\\mathcal B^r\\;\\exists Q\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m+r,k)}\\;(A=\\operatorname{Sec}_{m,k}^r(Q,\\vec\\beta))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}:=\\{A\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\vec\\beta\\in\\mathcal B^r\\;\\exists Q\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m+r,k)}\\;(A=\\operatorname{Sec}_{m,k}^r(Q,\\vec\\beta))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}:=\\{A\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\vec\\beta\\in\\mathcal B^r\\;\\exists Q\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m+r,k)}\\;(A=\\operatorname{Sec}_{m,k}^r(Q,\\vec\\beta))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}:=\\{A\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\vec\\beta\\in\\mathcal B^r\\;\\exists Q\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m+r,k)}\\;(A=\\operatorname{Sec}_{m,k}^r(Q,\\vec\\beta))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}:=\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\cap\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\qquad\\mathrm{Projective}^{(m,k)}:=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\cup\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\boldsymbol\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}:=\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\cap\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\qquad\\mathrm{Projective}^{(m,k)}:=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\cup\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书把对所有实数类 R 相对化的 analytical hierarchy 称为 projective hierarchy，并说明递归于 R 等价于给递归函数的若干实变量代入固定实数（18.1）。这里以有限参数 section 写出同一构造，粗体专门区别于无参数解析层级。每个有限程序只含有限个外加实函数符号，因此有限实参数 section 足以表达这种相对化；R=ℕ^ℕ 本身是 ZFC 中的集合。类与 section 都是幂集上的显式集合构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 是两类的交，不要求两种定义使用相同参数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-baire-space","status":"resolved","id":"4bd688e6777d088c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-baire-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-analytical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"4eb7f663287e8b98","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-baire-space","status":"resolved","id":"4bd688e6777d088c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m,k,r,n\\in\\mathbb N$，$n\\ge1$，$Q\\subseteq X_{m+r,k}$。$\\mathcal B=\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}$、$X_{m,k}=\\mathcal B^m\\times\\mathbb N^k$ 见 [[68-df-baire-space]]；无固定实参数的 $\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}$ 见 [[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]。$\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m$、$\\vec\\beta\\in\\mathcal B^r$、$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$；$\\frown$ 为有限元组连接，$r=0$ 时 $\\vec\\beta=()$。下式引入 section 算子 $\\operatorname{Sec}_{m,k}^r$ 及带任意有限实参数的粗体关系类。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-analytical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"4eb7f663