ive}^{(m,k)}:=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\cup\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false}],"bytes":2552,"backlinks":[{"id":"a8b8a34e241cffe0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$。$X_{0,k}=\\mathcal B^0\\times\\mathbb N^k$ 与 $\\mathbb N^k$ 通过 $((),\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow\\vec x$ 识别。粗体类见 [[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]，Borel 类见 [[68-df-borel-relation]]。"},{"id":"cc4e938a01248a42","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$。无参数解析类及带实参数投射类见 [[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]；$\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}$ 见 [[68-df-real-parameter-enumeration]]。"},{"id":"94e1d47d7b40b77a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 ZFC 中，$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$F:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(X_{m,k})$。$P\\subseteq X_{m,k+1}$ 满足 $\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in P\\leftrightarrow(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in F(y))$。粗体类见 [[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"2b92bd908c1baefd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-projective-hierarchy]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"混合元数与层级：[[68-df-baire-space]] → [[68-df-real-machine]] → [[68-df-recursive-real-function]] → [[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]] → [[68-df-projective-hierarchy]] → [[68-thm-separation-theorem]] → [[68-thm-suslin-theorem]]。有限二进制串另记为 $\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$，见 [[68-df-recursive-tree]]，不与 Baire 空间 $\\mathcal B$ 混用。"}],"outgoing":["4bd688e6777d088c","4eb7f663287e8b98